        "TileImage": "$($repository d78b0462-d8b8-4651-90a5-9ff14d043b25).Image",
        "Description": "Good Afternoon 47 \rA south sudanese warlord, who does not want to be named. Has contrated the ICA to carry out a hit on 5 targets.\r \rThe targets are former mercenaries, While conducting offensive operations against a local rebel group they attacked a wealthy family travelling on the road. \r\rLittle did they realise they were members of his family. \r\rAn inside source in interpol has informed us they they plan to raid the compound with help from colorado national guard.\r\r47 we MUST act now.",
